  dct:description "The competition is for a framework agreement for video production services and related services. First of all there is digital school communication the need is for, but other productions can also be relevant. The procurement ́s value is estimated to: NOK 3-600,000 excluding VAT per annum. The maximum value for the entire contract period, including any options and expected price rise: NOK 6,000,000 excluding VAT. The need is uncertain. The volume can vary both up and down and the contract period will depend on, among other things, the contracting authority ́s needs, activities, budgetary situations and other framework factors. See the procurement documents for further information."@en;
  dct:title "Video production, framework agreement"@en;
